{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"nav","type":"text","text":"# BossAI｜结构图\n14a完整构建与三项专项自动化通过；真实BT→GAS/资产/PIE待验。14b完整构建/两专项通过；真实BT SafeStop/异步Abort/结束顺序、PIE世界EndPlay/联机待验，E9完整动态未验。D–F仍为目标设计。\n[[BossAI/结构|结构文档]] · [[GGYGO_流程_BossAI.canvas|主流程]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Boss选招.canvas|选招]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas|换形态目标]]","x":0,"y":0,"width":1520,"height":175,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"definition","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOBossDefinition / ActionSet\nDefinition 提供 Form/Phase 与动作池。\nValidateConfiguration(OutError) → 全集 Tag/类/数值校验；IsDataValid 复用。\n坏行整集拒绝，空集/全基础零合法。\n[[计划_BOSSAI]]","x":0,"y":250,"width":410,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"encounter","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOBossEncounter\nbool SpawnBoss() → 仅Authority生成；拒绝已有对象、装配/清理重入及EndPlay后生成。\n前提：EditInstanceOnly属性BossDefinition已配置，Definition不是函数参数。\nGetBossState/Avatar/Controller → 查询装配成功的公开引用。\nCreatedBossState/Controller/Avatar → 弱创建责任，独立于Owner/当前Avatar。\nprotected EndPlay / CleanupCreatedBoss → 失败/撤场共用幂等回收；外部Avatar只解绑，不销毁。\n14b完整构建/两专项通过；真实BT/PIE/联机待验。","x":0,"y":620,"width":410,"height":365,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"state","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOBossState : AGGYGOCombatantState\nInitializeFromDefinition(Data) → 授予全形态能力、初始标签。\nGetCurrentFormTag / GetCurrentPhaseTag → 复制状态查询。\n继承AttachAvatar(NewPawn) / DetachAvatar(ExpectedPawn) → 权威绑定/身份安全解绑。\n持久ASC与Avatar引用归宿主；ExpectedASC/ActorInfo清理归宿主/PawnExtension。\n[[Combatants/结构|宿主接口]]","x":540,"y":250,"width":440,"height":330,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"avatar","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOBossCharacter\n`GetMeleeTraceComponent()` → GA 开关判定窗口。\nPawnExtension 绑定 BossState ASC；Mesh/CMC/碰撞属于当前形态 Pawn。","x":540,"y":640,"width":440,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"controller","type":"text","text":"## AGGYGOBossAIController\nSelectAction → 耗尽恢复/确定性抽签。\nStore/ConsumeActionSelection → 弱来源身份，一次消费原Spec。\nClearActionSelection → 清失效请求。\n持有BrainComponent；GetBrainComponent供Encounter请求StopLogic。\nUnPossess → 解除Pawn；换Avatar只PauseLogic。\n请求/派生权重归AI，冷却与执行归GAS。","x":1100,"y":250,"width":420,"height":370,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tasks","type":"text","text":"## BT 任务接口\nChooseBossAction::ExecuteTask → 校验/筛选，存原候选Spec，写Tag。\nActivateAbility::ExecuteTask → 消费请求并以原Handle请求GAS。\nOnTaskFinished/CleanupBinding → 解绑结束监听。\n14a完整构建/三项自动化通过；真实BT→GAS/资产/PIE仍待验。","x":1100,"y":630,"width":420,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"ga","type":"text","text":"## UGGYGOBossMeleeAbility\nDamageEffect非空优先；蓝图bUseSharedDamageEffectWhenUnset默认false。\nValidateMeleeConfiguration / HandleMeleeHit\n→ System：UGGYGOGameData::ResolveDamageGameplayEffect(覆盖,显式bool)\n只读预载快照，不加载/缓存。解析空在\nBuildHitEffectPayload前拒绝，不GE/Cue；\n有效类经AbilitySystem Builder/GAS执行。\nGA管Montage/Trace/CMC句柄，EndAbility广播前释放。\n15F已编译；选择/命中矩阵未专项动态验。\n[[System/结构|System]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|AbilitySystem]]","x":1100,"y":1000,"width":420,"height":350,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"future","type":"text","text":"## 目标设计（D–F，未实现）\n仇恨/目标服务、转阶段锁、换 Pawn 事务；BossState 持续持有 ASC，Controller 保持 Brain。\n[[GGYGO_流程_Boss换形态.canvas]]","x":540,"y":1050,"width":440,"height":230,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"contract","type":"text","text":"## 状态归属与验证边界\nEncounter持有创建责任与装配成功查询引用，调用Controller/Brain和宿主公共接口回收；不写ASC内部状态。\nState持有ASC/属性/Form/Phase及当前Avatar；PawnExtension仅缓存当前绑定；外部Avatar不自动转为Encounter创建对象。\nController持有Brain、随机流、派生权重和一次请求；GA持有任务/资源，GAS结算伤害，CMC执行位移。\n14a完整构建/专项自动化通过；14b完整构建/两专项通过，测试Brain只观察StopLogic调用入口。实际BT SafeStop/异步Abort、BT→GAS结束顺序、PIE世界EndPlay及联机仍待验。\n[[BossAI/结构|职责与门禁]] · [[Combatants/结构|解绑契约]] · [[Movement/结构|位移职责]] · [[BossAI/计划_Kevin_DemonBattle战斗接入|Kevin缺口]]\n目标/仇恨、完整阶段/换形态事务与Kevin接线保持后续范围。","x":0,"y":1370,"width":1450,"height":330,"color":"6"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1","fromNode":"definition","fromSide":"right","toNode":"state","toSide":"left","label":"初始化 Form / Phase 与能力"},
		{"id":"e2","fromNode":"encounter","fromSide":"right","toNode":"state","toSide":"left","label":"创建并记录责任；调用初始化 / DetachAvatar"},
		{"id":"e3","fromNode":"encounter","fromSide":"right","toNode":"avatar","toSide":"left","label":"创建初始Avatar；保留回收责任"},
		{"id":"e4","fromNode":"encounter","fromSide":"right","toNode":"controller","toSide":"left","label":"创建；调用Possess/UnPossess；查询Brain"},
		{"id":"e5","fromNode":"state","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"avatar","toSide":"top","label":"Attach/Detach经PawnExtension绑定/解绑"},
		{"id":"e6","fromNode":"controller","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"tasks","toSide":"top","label":"驱动 BT 任务"},
		{"id":"e7","fromNode":"tasks","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ga","toSide":"left","label":"经 ASC 激活已校验原 SpecHandle"},
		{"id":"e8","fromNode":"ga","fromSide":"left","toNode":"avatar","toSide":"right","label":"Montage / Trace 作用于当前 Pawn"},
		{"id":"e9","fromNode":"future","fromSide":"top","toNode":"state","toSide":"bottom","label":"目标：转阶段更新持久状态"}
